{
  "name": "EXPRESS-Bench RE baseline (random exploration)",
  "description": "Paper's Random Exploration baseline on env_express, faithful to upstream main.py: each step first runs the gpt-4o-mini stop check (explore.txt) on the current frame (skipped-on-black via env_express__stop_gate); on yes it answers WITH the decision frame (answer.txt) and exits; otherwise env_express__sample_waypoint teleports to a random navigable point within 3 m with uniform yaw. On budget truncation the answer uses random_answer.txt WITHOUT any image (main.py:421). Judge llmCall (gpt-4o-mini profile) returns delta/sigma; env_express__evaluate computes C / C* / E_path / d_T. Paper reference: RE C 36.95 / C* 62.75 / E_path 12.06.",
  "step_budget": 50,
