    {
      "id": "note",
      "type": "note",
      "label": "Baseline graph",
      "position": {
        "x": 560,
        "y": -340
      },
      "config": {
        "markdown": "**Random Exploration (paper baseline, faithful loop)**\n\nPer step (upstream main.py order): stop check FIRST on the current frame (`stop_llm` = explore.txt verbatim, gpt-4o-mini) -> `stop_gate` (black frames never stop) -> on continue, `sample_waypoint` random hop within 3 m + uniform yaw -> `step_pose` teleports, accumulating geodesic path length.\n\n**Verdict band**: `answer_router` branches on how the loop ended - early stop -> answer.txt WITH the decision frame; budget truncation -> random_answer.txt WITHOUT image (main.py:421). Judge = evaluation.txt + final frame -> delta, sigma -> C / C* / E_path / d_T.\n\n**All prompts verbatim from upstream prompt/*.txt.** Judge + stop + answer model: gpt-4o-mini (benchmark-native); select via active profile.\n\n**Known deviation**: on truncation the judge image is one frame later than upstream's (frame after the final hop vs frame at the final check).\n\n**Paper reference**: RE C 36.95 / C* 62.75 / E_path 12.06 (Table 2)."
      }
    }
  ],
